executor:node1:temporary-files"]},"overall_summary":"All material task outcomes are satisfied. The provider-wide node1 restart protocol is also complete: it captured a healthy pre-restart state and boot identity, acknowledged the scheduled restart, observed a changed boot identity, and directly verified recovered system services, account data, policy, and effective limits. The fixed lifecycle boot observations independently corroborate the reboot.","limitations":["Effective behavior was directly exercised through `runuser --login`, not an interactive console or SSH login. The earlier `su -` probe showed default limits because that distinct Arch Linux PAM service did not include pam_limits; therefore the behavioral evidence does not cover every conceivable user-switching/session-opening service (cmd-0b7332bacb214c04, cmd-35718e35fac94140, cmd-56580ee9b9164009)."]}
